### 1. Lista de reseñas (200)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/resenas
Accept: application/json

### 2. Filtro por plataforma (200)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/resenas?plataforma=PC
Accept: application/json

### 3. Detalle por slug (200)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/resenas/analisis-de-nebula-rift
Accept: application/json

### 4. Slug inexistente (404)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/resenas/no-existe
Accept: application/json

### 5. Borrador (404)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/resenas/analisis-de-cumbre-hueca-borrador
Accept: application/json

### 6. Noticias (200)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/noticias
Accept: application/json
